---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { TAGLINE, SUPPORT_URL, DISCLOSURE } from "../lib/episodes";
---
<Base title="About" description="All Saints tells the story of one lesser-known saint each day, on their feast day.">
  <article class="wrap about">
    <h1 class="name">About All Saints</h1>
    <p class="devotional lead">{TAGLINE}</p>
    <p>Every morning, All Saints tells the story of one lesser-known Catholic saint on their feast day: a bishop, a martyr, a doorkeeper, a slave who died beside his master. Each story is a one-minute video on Instagram and YouTube, and a longer page here with its sources.</p>
    <p>We separate what history records from what tradition holds, and we never invent a saint's words. Each story ends the way the Church has always ended them: Saint ___, pray for us.</p>
    <h2 class="label">How it's made</h2>
    <p>{DISCLOSURE}</p>
    <h2 class="label">Follow</h2>
    <p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/all.holy.saints/">Instagram @all.holy.saints</a> · <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@AllHolySaints">YouTube @AllHolySaints</a> · <a href="mailto:hello@allholysaints.com">hello@allholysaints.com</a></p>
    {SUPPORT_URL && <a class="rubric support" href={SUPPORT_URL} rel="noopener"><span>🕯 Light a candle<small>Help keep the forgotten remembered.</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a>}
  </article>
</Base>
<style>
  .about { max-width: 42rem; display: grid; gap: 16px; padding-top: 16px; }
  .lead { font-size: 1.4375rem; color: var(--gilt-light); }
  h2 { color: var(--gilt); font-weight: 400; margin-top: 20px; }
  .support { margin-top: 24px; max-width: 30rem; }
</style>
